'''Missing''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is white with purple, orange, and black glitched pixels imprinted on it. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It is a reference to Pokémon’s glitched [[w:c:pokemon:MissingNo.|MissingNo.]]
* It was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/60110684/profile/ PlainDevils].
* The original name of this knife was "missingtab".
* This is one of the many knives that are from other Murder games.
* The description of this knife is: "It didn't leave a trace."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/163999408/SKIN-missingstab Model created by PlainDevils]</ref>

